Note for whoever runs these: `DATABASE_URL` must carry the password from
docker-compose.yml, or roughly 520 schema tests silently skip rather than
fail. `UV_NATIVE_TLS=1` is required on a host running TLS-inspecting
antivirus, or six tests in tests/checks/test_gateway_no_provider_env.py error
on certificate verification.
